# Worksheet

**F1 Core loop**: state S; rnd(S) mulberry32-style PRNG used everywhere (stepStorm, genTerrain, events); endTurn() calls fixed order stepStorm→...→stepEvents. Score 2.

**F2 Map**: 64-tile grid, genTerrain(seed) walk-based generation; canBuild checks d.terr.indexOf(t.terr); plan() adjN bonus adds to out{} used in stepProduction. Score 2.

**F3 Economy**: composter ash→soil, forge ore→metal, greenhouse soil/water→food; caps(S) + add() clamps and logs overflow. Score 2.

**F4 Population**: colonist records {skill,fatigue,morale,assign}; plan() reads w.skill (sm) and w.fatigue (fm) in output formula. Score 2.

**F5 Needs**: stepNeeds take(food/water), shortage -> moraleAll(negative); morale read as mm in plan(); resting colonists recover morale/fatigue (stepMorale). Score 2.

**F6 Research**: 13 TECH nodes, techState() enforces pre[], research() pays cost; techMods() applies real bonuses read inside plan(), stormMitigation reads shutters/sealed, buyPrice/sellPrice read charter. Score 2.

**F7 Events**: 14 EVENTS, weighted pool w/tot in stepEvents; wanderers/raiders/tunnel/sickness/rumour/vigil (6) offer 2-3 choices with distinct run()s; S.ecd[id]=8 cooldown filtered each pick. Score 2.

**F8 Trade**: scarcity(S,r) reads S.res[r]/cap, market.drift random-walked in stepMarket; car.stock qty decremented in tradeBuy; tradeBuy/tradeSell both mutate state. Score 2.

**F9 Hazard**: stepStorm every STORM_EVERY turns, sev grows w/ turn/15; damaged tile mult=0 in plan(); windbreak/shutters lower stormMitigation(); stepRepairs spends parts to fix. Score 2.

**F10 Save/load**: saveString JSON.stringify(S); loadString validates required fields/terrain/building ids/colonist shape and returns {err:...} on bad input. Score 2.

**F11 End conditions**: checkEnd() pop<=0 loss, turn>WIN_TURN win via needsMet(); score() sums pop/research/stock/turns/win; renderModal() shows summary table. Score 2.

**F12 UI**: data-tab click handler switches UI.tab; log lines show 'T'+e.t; tooltips via data-tip/tipAttr everywhere; Space/1-6 keydown handlers; media query + maprap overflow-x for narrow screens. Score 2.

**F13 Dev panel**: runTests() 32 assertions on real invariants (caps, roster uniqueness, repair cost, storm cadence, hash roundtrip); runBenchmark() drives botTurn() headlessly and prints stateHash(S). Score 2.

**G1**: techMods(S,id,out,inp,notes) mutates out/inp read by plan()->stepProduction every turn; e.g. sifting +3 ash visible in tooltip. Score 4.

**G2**: stepNeeds shortage -> moraleAll(negative) -> c.morale -> plan() mm=0.5+0.005*morale reduces fout every turn. Score 4.

**G3**: stepStorm sets t.b.damaged=true -> plan() mult=0 -> stepRepairs spends parts(repairCost) and sets damaged=false restoring output next turn. Score 4.

**G4**: buyPrice/sellPrice = BASE_PRICE*drift(S.market.drift, random-walked in stepMarket)*scarcity(S.res[r]/cap). Score 4.

**G5**: wanderers choice adds colonists/food/water/morale differently per branch; raiders choice mutates parts/metal/scrip/fatigue differently per branch. Score 4.

